fill_*, filltie, endcap: 0 devices in official SPICE/CDL (physical-only).
gf180mcuD_setup.tcl: ignore class for fill_[[:digit:]]+, filltie, endcap.
fillcap_* have MOSFETs and are compared (parallel enable), not ignored.

